{"turn_id": "d12-t1", "session_id": "d12", "turn": 1, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "f1_score", "text": "The fine-tuned BERT model gives an F1-score of 0.89 for the concept recognition task.", "citations": [{"paper_id": "2003.11687", "chunk_id": "c-35ae853dec5dd79f61ef4980"}]}, {"key": "data_split", "text": "An 80-20 data split is used for training and evaluation.", "citations": [{"paper_id": "2003.11687", "chunk_id": "c-35ae853dec5dd79f61ef4980"}]}, {"key": "detailed_performance_location", "text": "Detailed performance of the concept recognition is shown in Tables 2 and 3.", "citations": [{"paper_id": "2003.11687", "chunk_id": "c-35ae853dec5dd79f61ef4980"}]}, {"key": "spacy_comparison", "text": "An implementation of concept recognition using spaCy also produced similar results.", "citations": [{"paper_id": "2003.11687", "chunk_id": "c-35ae853dec5dd79f61ef4980"}]}, {"key": "method_setup", "text": "The approach performs multi-class token classification with BERT's pre-trained cased language model via BertForTokenClassification, giving it full fine-tuning.", "citations": [{"paper_id": "2003.11687", "chunk_id": "c-35ae853dec5dd79f61ef4980"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d12-t1", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
{"turn_id": "d12-t2", "session_id": "d12", "turn": 2, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "bert_model_choice", "text": "论文选择 BERT 进行概念识别（CR）的微调，理由是 BERT 具有通用性并使用上下文化词嵌入。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "2003.11687", "chunk_id": "c-35ae853dec5dd79f61ef4980"}]}, {"key": "bert_setup", "text": "作者使用 BERT 预训练的 cased 语言模型做多类分类，借助 pytorch transformers 与 hugging face，采用 BertForTokenClassification；文本被嵌入为带最大 token 长度的 token 与 mask，输入预训练 BERT 做完整微调。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "2003.11687", "chunk_id": "c-35ae853dec5dd79f61ef4980"}]}, {"key": "bert_f1", "text": "该模型在概念识别任务上取得 F1 分数 0.89。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "2003.11687", "chunk_id": "c-35ae853dec5dd79f61ef4980"}]}, {"key": "data_split", "text": "训练与评估采用 80-20 的数据划分。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "2003.11687", "chunk_id": "c-35ae853dec5dd79f61ef4980"}]}, {"key": "tables", "text": "CR 的详细性能展示在表 2 和表 3 中。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "2003.11687", "chunk_id": "c-35ae853dec5dd79f61ef4980"}]}, {"key": "spacy_comparison", "text": "作者还用 spaCy 实现了 CR，其结果与 BERT 方案相似。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "2003.11687", "chunk_id": "c-35ae853dec5dd79f61ef4980"}]}, {"key": "task_formulation", "text": "论文把该问题表述为与命名实体抽取类似的 token 分类任务，并通过预训练语言模型在概念标注数据集上微调来识别系统工程概念。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "2003.11687", "chunk_id": "c-7e9b5fdcd1b735fa2b7de65a"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d12-t2", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
{"turn_id": "d12-t3", "session_id": "d12", "turn": 3, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "polyglot_finetuned_performance", "text": "在 Polyglot Semantic Role Labeling 中，微调/训练的模型（多语混合训练与单语基线）在 CoNLL-2009 的七个语言上评估；简单 polyglot 训练除捷克语无变化外优于单语训练，训练样例最少的德语、日语、加泰罗尼亚语提升最大，而数据量大的捷克语、中文提升很小或没有。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1805.11598", "chunk_id": "c-bb02e8199a80bde6c03e4d79"}, {"paper_id": "1805.11598", "chunk_id": "c-d2d99eebfd526f64d0796b70"}]}, {"key": "polyglot_labeler_resources", "text": "Polyglot 标注器通过组合 CoNLL 2009 共享任务中一对语言的资源构建（不依赖平行语料），采用在多语言上训练一个模型的 polyglot 训练方式，并可额外纳入英语部分的监督。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1805.11598", "chunk_id": "c-8b21bd8c4c41f76753d2758d"}, {"paper_id": "1805.11598", "chunk_id": "c-ab37506cf0e270f6ab4a5722"}]}, {"key": "seva_finetuned_performance", "text": "在 Common-Knowledge Concept Recognition for SEVA 中，使用预训练 BERT 经全量微调（80-20 划分训练与评估）进行概念识别，模型取得 F1 分数 0.89。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "2003.11687", "chunk_id": "c-35ae853dec5dd79f61ef4980"}]}, {"key": "seva_labeler_resources", "text": "SEVA 的概念识别标注器/数据集借助领域专家与文本处理方法构建词级标注数据集，并通过定义标注方案训练序列模型；此外还创建了系统工程领域缩写与定义等必要数据集。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "2003.11687", "chunk_id": "c-7e9b5fdcd1b735fa2b7de65a"}, {"paper_id": "2003.11687", "chunk_id": "c-945a37a61c8991cd2adfcf07"}]}, {"key": "comparability", "text": "两篇论文的任务、数据集与资源基础不同：Polyglot 在 CoNLL-2009 七语的语义角色标注上以多语言/跨语言资源组合训练一个模型；SEVA 在领域专家标注的系统工程概念识别数据集上用预训练 BERT 微调，故其微调性能数字与资源组合不可直接比较。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1805.11598", "chunk_id": "c-d2d99eebfd526f64d0796b70"}, {"paper_id": "1805.11598", "chunk_id": "c-8b21bd8c4c41f76753d2758d"}, {"paper_id": "2003.11687", "chunk_id": "c-35ae853dec5dd79f61ef4980"}, {"paper_id": "2003.11687", "chunk_id": "c-7e9b5fdcd1b735fa2b7de65a"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d12-t3", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
